    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741090/extras/7106f9dcbc7be590ac7abf3fc97af985.poster.avif?t=1746134046\" width=590 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741090/extras/7106f9dcbc7be590ac7abf3fc97af985.webm?t=1746134046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741090/extras/7106f9dcbc7be590ac7abf3fc97af985.mp4?t=1746134046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Build the <strong>island of your dreams</strong> - either by hand or using <strong>procedural generation tools</strong>.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Build your island<br></li><li> Complete objectives<br></li><li> Unlock new tools and items<br></li><li> Export your creations with the <strong>screenshot tool</strong> or the <strong>3D model exporter</strong></li></ul><br>Create <strong>cozy islands</strong> while completing objectives to unlock new items &amp; tools. Adjust the quantity of bridges, the maximum height of the terrain, and meticulously tweak configurations to create unique island worlds!<br><br>Experience the feeling of <strong>painting</strong> the landscape, adjusting the island\u2019s size and coastline with <i>meticulous</i> detail. Add trees, houses, bridges, rocks, animals, and much more!<br><br>The procedural toolset allows for detailed adjustments to be made for all facets of the island\u2019s development. Adjust the quantity of bridges, the maximum height of the terrain, and even the proximity of trees to one another. <br><br>You\u2019ll spend hours tweaking all the configurations to generate uniquely enthralling island worlds!<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741090/extras/7106f9dcbc7be590ac7abf3fc97af985.poster.avif?t=1746134046\" width=590 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741090/extras/7106f9dcbc7be590ac7abf3fc97af985.webm?t=1746134046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741090/extras/7106f9dcbc7be590ac7abf3fc97af985.mp4?t=1746134046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Build the <strong>island of your dreams</strong> - either by hand or using <strong>procedural generation tools</strong>.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Build your island<br></li><li> Complete objectives<br></li><li> Unlock new tools and items<br></li><li> Export your creations with the <strong>screenshot tool</strong> or the <strong>3D model exporter</strong></li></ul><br>Create <strong>cozy islands</strong> while completing objectives to unlock new items &amp; tools. Adjust the quantity of bridges, the maximum height of the terrain, and meticulously tweak configurations to create unique island worlds!<br><br>Experience the feeling of <strong>painting</strong> the landscape, adjusting the island\u2019s size and coastline with <i>meticulous</i> detail. Add trees, houses, bridges, rocks, animals, and much more!<br><br>The procedural toolset allows for detailed adjustments to be made for all facets of the island\u2019s development. Adjust the quantity of bridges, the maximum height of the terrain, and even the proximity of trees to one another. <br><br>You\u2019ll spend hours tweaking all the configurations to generate uniquely enthralling island worlds!<br><br>",
    "short_description": "Build the island of your dreams - either by hand or using procedural generation tools. Create cozy islands while completing objectives to unlock new items &amp; tools. Adjust the quantity of bridges, the maximum height of the terrain, and meticulously tweak configurations to create unique island worlds!",
